      "cooked": "<p>So, help me out here in case i'm posting in the wrong section, but I'm reletively new to the forums.</p><p>I'm wondering about some of the nemesis choices for heroes/villains. specifically some that don't make sense to me from a lore standpoint, and i'm hoping someone else here can help me make sense of them.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>first and fore most, i don't understand why la Capitan is the nemesis of the Sentinels. Did i miss a part where they were a part of each other's stories?</p><p>secondly, Kismet and Setback. are they linked at all other than their abilities being about luck manipulations?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>i'm sure there are others, but i'm away from my decks ATM. does anyone have any answers for these? does anyone else have any quetsions that they don't quite get?&nbsp;</p>",
