      "raw": "<p>So, help me out here in case i&#39;m posting in the wrong section, but I&#39;m reletively new to the forums.</p><p>I&#39;m wondering about some of the nemesis choices for heroes/villains. specifically some that don&#39;t make sense to me from a lore standpoint, and i&#39;m hoping someone else here can help me make sense of them.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>first and fore most, i don&#39;t understand why la Capitan is the nemesis of the Sentinels. Did i miss a part where they were a part of each other&#39;s stories?</p><p>secondly, Kismet and Setback. are they linked at all other than their abilities being about luck manipulations?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>i&#39;m sure there are others, but i&#39;m away from my decks ATM. does anyone have any answers for these? does anyone else have any quetsions that they don&#39;t quite get?&nbsp;</p>",
