      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Pydro\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/48/1844_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Pydro:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>For La Capitan and the Sentinels:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sentinelsofthemultiverse.com/multiverse/heroes/the-sentinels\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://sentinelsofthemultiverse.com/multiverse/heroes/the-sentinels</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I completely forgot about that! thank you, it was bugging me.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>And yes, i do know that they are up for february, i was just wondeing if we had an established reason yet <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> looking forward to the letters page, tuesdays are quickly becoming my favorite days of the week. EDIT: I have submitted a question to the letter's page in regards to this. here's hoping my name gets on air! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>And thank you very much for the warm welcome <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
