      "created_at": "2017-02-22T05:34:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>To be fair, she didn't know she was actually cursing him. &nbsp;Just like most people who say \"Go *** yourself\" don't actually expect the target of their crudity to do as instructed.</p><p>Although yes, she did take their breakup harder than he did. &nbsp;</p>",
